WEBVTT

00:08:29.908 --> 00:08:31.351
knowing laugh --

00:08:31.375 --> 00:08:32.409
(Laughter)

00:08:32.433 --> 00:08:35.857
you can't reveal what you do for a living.

00:08:36.437 --> 00:08:38.184
For a mom's dinner,

00:08:38.208 --> 00:08:39.877
where you want to upend the norms

00:08:39.901 --> 00:08:44.416
of what women who also happen
to be mothers talk about when they gather,

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:47.497
if you talk about your kids,
you have to take a shot.

00:08:47.521 --> 00:08:50.139
(Laughter)

00:08:50.624 --> 00:08:51.938
That's a real dinner.

00:08:53.258 --> 00:08:55.303
Rules are powerful,

00:08:55.327 --> 00:09:00.196
because they allow us to temporarily
change and harmonize our behavior.